<view class="device-page"><view class="nav-bar"><text class="back-btn" bindtap="{{a}}">←</text><text class="title">登录设备管理</text></view><view class="warning"><text>以下是最近登录过您的帐号的设备情况，若您发现非本人操作，请及时删除，以保障您的设备安全。</text></view><view class="device-list"><view wx:for="{{b}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:key="g" class="device-item"><view class="device-info"><uni-icons wx:if="{{c}}" u-i="{{item.a}}" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{c}}"></uni-icons><view class="device-details"><text class="device-name">{{item.b}}</text><text class="login-time">登录时间：{{item.c}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.d}}" class="current-device">当前设备</text></view></view><view class="actions"><button wx:if="{{item.e}}" class="delete-btn" bindtap="{{item.f}}">删除</button></view></view></view></view>